<title>USA: Sunrise Assisted names president.</title>
<headline>Sunrise Assisted names president.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFAX, Va. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunrise Assisted Living Inc on Tuesday said it named Chief Financial Officer David Faeder to the president's position.</p>
<p>Sunrise founder Paul Klaassen will remain chairman and chief executive of the company, and Faeder will continue to hold the chief financial officer's post.</p>
<p>In addition, the company said its wholly owned management company, Sunrise Assisted Living Management Inc, named Sunrise Chief Operating Officer Timothy Smick as its president.</p>
<p>Smick will retain his chief operating officer title.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
